  "nonNavigableContext": "Roofline, city buildings, rose borders, glass/furnace enclosures and display furniture are solid scenery. The atelier rooms, main terrace, open garden stair and both garden side stair routes are authored circulation.",
  "lessons": [
    "N20 independent correction made collision ownership explicit per seat. Every N21 rear chair tile contains actual chair-leg pixels rather than a shared floor strip.",
    "Generated central gate and arbor crossbar obstructed the apparent main route; a targeted edit opened the gate and removed the overhead crossbar while preserving the rose-garden composition.",
    "The first internal glass display choked the east-room passage. An isolated art edit created a genuine broad connecting floor instead of turning off its collision.",
    "Repeated diagonal rose paths were too narrow after32px rasterization. Widened the actual path artwork and removed two small terrace lamp pedestals before enabling matching floor cells.",
    "Physical-footprint repair explicitly protects real depicted table leg cells missed by threshold rasterization; no empty safety strip added."
  ]
